{
  "id": "encounter_21_secret_realm",
  "title": "仙缘秘境 — 上古洞府现世",
  "description": "灵气异常聚集之处，一道空间裂缝隐约可见，通向未知的上古秘境",
  "type": "exploration",
  "probability": 0.10,
  "trigger_conditions": {
    "region": "zhongyuan",
    "min_realm": "foundation_establishing_mid",
    "cooldown_minutes": 15
  },
  "dao_heart_alignment": "neutral",
  "start_node": "SECRET_REALM_START",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "SECRET_REALM_START",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你行至一处山谷，突然感到周围灵气异常浓郁。\n前方空间微微扭曲，一道裂缝若隐若现，散发着古老的气息...\n\n这似乎是一处上古秘境的入口！",
      "next_node": "SECRET_REALM_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "SECRET_REALM_CHOICE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "秘境入口在你面前缓缓展开，你能感受到其中蕴含的机缘与危险并存。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "enter_immediately",
          "text": "毫不犹豫地踏入秘境，机缘不等人",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "skill_check", "target": "courage", "operator": ">=", "value": 15}
          ],
          "next_node": "SECRET_REALM_ENTER_CHECK"
        },
        {
          "id": "prepare_first",
          "text": "先在外围布置防护阵法，做好准备再进入",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "time_advance", "value": 10},
            {"type": "dao_heart_change", "value": 3}
          ],
          "next_node": "SECRET_REALM_PREPARE"
        },
        {
          "id": "mark_location",
          "text": "记下此地位置，日后再来探索",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "map_mark", "target": "ancient_secret_realm", "value": true},
            {"type": "reputation_change", "target": "cautious_cultivator", "value": 2}
          ],
          "next_node": "SECRET_REALM_MARK_END"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SECRET_REALM_ENTER_CHECK",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你果断踏入空间裂缝，一阵天旋地转后落入秘境之中。\n\n四周灵气充盈，远处隐约可见一座古殿。\n\n[b]道心坚定：[/b]你成功进入上古秘境，机缘在前！",
      "next_node": "SECRET_REALM_HALL_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "SECRET_REALM_PREPARE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你在入口处布下三重防护阵法，确认退路安全后步入秘境。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]上古秘境探索机会\n[b]道心：[/b]+3\n[b]时间流逝：[/b]10分钟\n\n稳重的准备让你在秘境中更加从容。",
      "next_node": "SECRET_REALM_HALL_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "SECRET_REALM_MARK_END",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你用灵力在空间标记上此地的坐标，将入口位置牢记于心。\n\n此地机缘非同小可，待修为提升后再来探索也不迟。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]秘境位置标记",
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "SECRET_REALM_HALL_CHOICE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你来到古殿前，殿门上刻着四个大字——\n\n[b]\"道法自然\"[/b]\n\n殿门半开，内有灵光闪烁，似乎藏着莫大的机缘。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "explore_hall",
          "text": "进入古殿，一探究竟",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "item_give", "target": "ancient_cultivation_manual", "value": 1},
            {"type": "dao_heart_change", "value": 8}
          ],
          "next_node": "SECRET_REALM_HALL_END"
        },
        {
          "id": "search_perimeter",
          "text": "先在外围搜寻，看看有没有其他收获",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "item_give", "target": "spirit_stone_fragment", "value": 5},
            {"type": "skill_check", "target": "perception", "operator": ">=", "value": 12}
          ],
          "next_node": "SECRET_REALM_SEARCH_END"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SECRET_REALM_HALL_END",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你踏入古殿，殿中悬浮着一本散发着灵光的古籍。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]上古修真功法残卷（玄阶）\n[b]道心：[/b]+8\n\n此功法虽然残缺，但其中蕴含的道法精妙绝伦，值得日后参悟。",
      "next_node": "END"
    },
    {
      "id": "SECRET_REALM_SEARCH_END",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你在古殿外围仔细搜寻，发现了数块散落的灵石碎片。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]灵石碎片 x5\n\n虽然未能进入古殿核心，但这些灵石碎片也是不小的收获。",
      "next_node": "END"
    }
  ]
}
